{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "38a50311-952d-8d3d-aa26-b54c78ac174a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T15:52:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:50:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. Marco Barone. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this line, but I'm hoping somebody actually picks up the messages."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got you live right now. What's going on, Marco?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The low spot at the end of my block is under about a foot of water. A foot. And that soaker ended Thursday, three days ago. It's not rain anymore, so where's it coming from? Nobody cleared that drain, that's what I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a foot of standing water three days later, that's not normal. Is it covering the whole road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:21-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Basically yeah, curb to curb. Cars are going through it slow and throwing wakes into the yards, which is great. And there's an older gentleman at the end of the block who can't get out. He's got a walker, no way he's wading through that. Nobody's checking on him either, because why would they."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is he okay otherwise? Does he need emergency help, medical or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, he's fine, he's just stuck. I brought him groceries this morning. I just want somebody to look at the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good of you. Hang on one second, let me pull up the crew list. Stay with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:51:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure. [pause] I'm just scrolling through the pictures I took, I've got like twelve of this puddle. Honestly it looks like a pond. Somebody should be embarrassed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Sorry about that. What's the street, or the cross street, so I can put it on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd rather not give my own address, just put the end of the block, the low spot where it dips by the stop sign. Is that enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I need a street name for the crew to find it, even without your house number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, but then who do I call to get it checked in the future? Because I shouldn't have to keep chasing this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This line is the right one, and weekends it goes to the on-call crew. Give me the street and I'll mark it urgent because of the neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hang on, the line's not great. [line breaks up] Can you hear me now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T15:52:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got you. Go ahead."
    }
  ],
